  "description": "Description:  NASA's Artemis program is making incredible progress on its mission to land the first woman and person of color on the lunar surface. Recent work included the lift and transfer of the Orion spacecraft, the second Green Run core stage test at Stennis Space Center, MS, and the shipment, arrival, and transfer of the Space Launch System rocket core stage to the Vehicle Assembly Building at Kennedy Space Center FL. NASA’s Artemis program will lead humanity forward to the Moon and prepare us for the next giant leap, the exploration of Mars.",
